# Hollins Cannery's vats room with a work suit (CIPlay hollins_cannery_acidsuit, 11-12 w10; in a test world 'CI ...').
# The suit box by the annex door (hcvatsuits, -9.4 14.6) gives 180 s of suit; into the vats room to the foreman's
# locker and back out, unhurt, with the brine still there.
island Hollins Cannery keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at -9 16 h=4.5
use hcvatsuits
expect shown hcvats
walk -9 16 to -6.75 13 to -6.75 9.8
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Foreman's spare locker
wait 2
expect item CopperIngot 1
picture hc_vats_in -6.75 5.2 12.6 -6.75 3.4 9.4 light=20
walk -6.75 9.8 to -6.75 13 to -6.75 16.5
expect unhurt
